      '- [Ace Meet](/pods/ace-meet) for meetings involving two to four people',
      '- [Ace Hub](/pods/ace-hub) for larger sessions involving up to six people',
      '## Choose based on the task',
      'Choose a phone booth when the main problem is individual calls taking place at open desks. It uses less floor area and avoids having one person occupy a larger meeting room.',
      'Choose a larger office pod when users need more internal working space, when two people regularly meet face to face, or when small teams need an enclosed room for hybrid calls and project discussions.',
      '| Workplace need | Recommended format |',
