      'Review [office pod pricing](/pricing) and the [Malaysia price guide](/articles/office-pod-price-guide-malaysia) for current model comparisons.',
      '## Frequently asked questions',
      '### Is a phone booth the same as an office pod?',
      'A phone booth is a type of office pod. It normally refers to a compact one-person model, while office pod can also describe larger focus, interview, and meeting spaces.',
      '### Can an office phone booth be used for focused work?',
