      '### Are office phone booths soundproof?',
      'They reduce sound and improve call privacy, but should not be assumed to be completely soundproof. Ask for a stated acoustic specification and consider the surrounding office conditions.',
      '### When should I buy a meeting pod instead?',
      'Choose a meeting pod when two or more people regularly need to use the space together. Do not rely on a one-person booth for interviews, coaching, or team meetings.',
