      'Set criteria first, then compare products. Suppliers whose marketing meets the criteria will stand up to scrutiny; those that do not will become apparent quickly.',
      '## 1-person office pods',
      'Single-person pods — often called phone booths or focus booths — are the most widely deployed category in Malaysian offices. They are used for video calls, private phone conversations, interviews, and focused deep work.',
