      '- Ventilation: active air supply and extraction sufficient for 30+ minutes of continuous use',
      '- Power: at minimum a 13A socket plus USB charging ports',
      '- Door: appropriate hinge and handle quality for heavy daily use',
      'The [Ace Uno](/pods/ace-uno) and [Ace Plus](/pods/ace-plus) are both one-person pods. Ace Uno has no published dB rating in its supplied product sheet; Ace Plus has an unverified first-party approximately 27 dB(A) claim with no verified supporting test document provided. Compare their dimensions, ventilation, work surface, and verified documentation before selecting.',
      '## 3–4 person meeting pods',
      'Meeting pods accommodate group conversations that a single-occupant booth cannot. They are used for team huddles, HR discussions, client video calls on shared screens, and planning sessions. The acoustic challenge is greater because multiple speakers generate more ambient noise inside the pod.',
      '**Key specifications to verify:**',
      '- Internal seating arrangement: request a seating diagram confirming three or four adults can sit with a shared table',
      '- Group acoustic performance: the pod must contain multiple speakers — confirm the certified figure reflects group use',
      '- Ventilation capacity: air changes must be sufficient for four occupants at full load',
      '- Display connectivity: HDMI or USB-C input for a shared screen',
      '- Door clearance: wide enough for comfortable entry and exit in a group',
      'The [Ace Meet](/pods/ace-meet) accommodates 3–4 people. No published dB rating is stated for Ace Meet on this site; review [all models](/office-pods) for dimensions and model-specific information.',
      '## 6–8 person collaboration hubs',
      'Larger pods are used for workshops, department-level meetings, and multi-party video calls. They require more floor area and heavier installation planning.',
      '**Key considerations:**',
      '- Floor area: typically 4m² or more of clear space plus door swing clearance and fire egress',
      '- Floor loading: confirm the building can support the pod weight; request a structural loading specification',
      '- Air handling: at this occupancy, standalone ventilation may need supplementing with building HVAC',
      '- Pre-purchase visit: at this size, an in-person test of acoustic performance and space feel is strongly recommended before signing',
      'The [Ace Hub](/pods/ace-hub) accommodates 6–8 people. Ace operates a showroom in Klang where full-size pods can be tested before purchase. [Book a visit](/contact).',
      '## Shortlisting process',
      'For any supplier on your list, request: (1) the acoustic test certificate from the third-party testing body, (2) the full installed price to your location, (3) a client reference in a comparable industry, and (4) the written warranty terms.',
      'Ace Pods publishes pricing at [aceofficepods.com/pricing](/pricing). Ace publishes an unverified first-party approximately 27 dB(A) claim for Ace Plus only; no verified supporting test document has been provided. Request documentary evidence for acoustic, installation-count, and client-reference claims before relying on them.',
      '## Frequently asked questions',
      '### What should I look for in the best office pod in Malaysia?',
      'Start with seating capacity and use case, then verify acoustic certification method (third-party or self-reported), installed pricing transparency, local warranty coverage, and the supplier installation track record. A pod that meets all four criteria is a stronger choice than one that scores on marketing alone.',
      '### What is the price range for office pods in Malaysia?',
