      'Locally manufactured pods avoid import duties and typically have lower logistics costs and clearer local support paths. Imported pods may carry longer lead times and less predictable after-sales support. Total cost of ownership — including installation, maintenance, and support — is a more meaningful comparison than headline price alone.'
