      'Most KL offices start with one or two call booths and one meeting pod. This covers the highest-frequency use cases — private calls and small team sessions — without overcommitting floor space.',
      '## Corporate procurement in KL offices',
      'Many KL purchases go through a procurement or facilities team rather than being decided by one person. Ace provides formal written quotations with line-item pricing, product specifications, floor loading data, and warranty documentation for teams that need this for internal sign-off or building management approval.',
      'For Grade A buildings with strict building management requirements, Ace can provide installation method statements and material safety data on request. [Contact the team](/contact) with your building name and procurement requirements.',
