      'Ace Office Pods operates a showroom in Klang where all models can be tested before purchase. The showroom is appointment-only and approximately 30 to 45 minutes from most KL locations. Testing the acoustic performance in person — closing the door and making a real call — is the most reliable way to confirm whether a pod meets your requirements.',
      '[Book a showroom visit](/contact) or [WhatsApp the team directly](https://wa.link/9umr4q) to discuss your KL office requirements.',
      '## Frequently asked questions',
      '### Do Ace Office Pods deliver to Kuala Lumpur?',
      'Ace Office Pods offers delivery and installation across Kuala Lumpur, including KLCC, KL Sentral, Bangsar South, Mont Kiara, Damansara Heights, and surrounding areas. Confirm the provider, charges, and scope in the quotation.',
      '### How long does delivery take to a KL office?',
